      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003eBetter (1 \u003c\u003c (order - 1)) instead of order (so that it would remain correct if order was bigger than 2)?\n\nHere though, order can only be 2 or 1. I understand for a future scenario, order can go beyond 2, let\u0027s say 3. But then, QI may be stipulated to be only 3 pages (not 4) and QI desc may happen to occupy 5 pages, in case which `(1 \u003c\u003c (order - 1))` would be wrong.",
